An '''End Stone Rose''' is a {{Rare}} item dropped by {{MobSprite|End Stone Protector;End Stone Protectors}}.

== Obtaining ==
An '''End Stone Rose''' is a guaranteed drop from killing the {{MobSprite|End Stone Protector}} in {{zone|The End}}.

== Usage ==
{{NPCSprite|Pablo}} has a {{Green|10%}} chance to request an '''End Stone Rose''' in exchange for {{Reputation|Mage|25}}.

== Trivia ==
*The '''End Stone Rose''' references {{MobSprite|Iron Golem;Iron Golems}} offering a {{Item|Poppy}} to villagers and dropping them on death in Vanilla Minecraft.
*The '''End Stone Rose''' replaced the previous {{Item|Poppy}} drop for the purpose of being sold to merchants for {{c|3k}}.

